meta {
  name: Search Products
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/products/search?q=cotton+shirt&limit=10
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  ## GET /api/products/search

  Full-text search across product names, descriptions, categories, brands, and tags.
  Uses pgvector semantic similarity when available; falls back to Prisma full-text.

  ### Query Parameters
  | Param | Type    | Description                               |
  |-------|---------|-------------------------------------------|
  | q     | string  | ✅ Search query (min 2 chars)             |
  | limit | integer | Max results returned, defaults to `10`    |

  ### Success (200)
  ```json
  {
    "results": [
      { "id": "...", "name": "Cotton Shirt", "slug": "...", "priceEgp": 450, "imageUrl": "..." }
    ]
  }
  ```
}
